<title>USA: Envoy completes Aetna unit acquisition.</title>
<headline>Envoy completes Aetna unit acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>BLUE BELL, Pa. 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Envoy Corp said Thursday it completed the acquisition of Aetna Inc's Healthcare Data Interchange Corp for $36.4 million.</p>
<p>Envoy announced June 16 it would buy the unit from Aetna subsidiary Aetna U.S. Healthcare.</p>
<p>Under the deal, Aetna U.S. Healthcare will use Envoy for its electronic health care transactions.</p>
<p>Envoy is a provider of electronic data interchange services to the health industry. Its stock closed at 26-7/8 Thursday.</p>
